<title>SPAIN: Pryca gross Jan sales up 2.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pryca gross Jan sales up 2.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket chain Pryca said on Tuesday its gross group sales rose 2.5 percent year on year in January.</p>
<p>Gross sales totalled 48.45 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
